warning[useless_resizable]: `parts` is a resizable array that only ever holds 2 elements
  --> tests/lint/useless_resizable/bad.jai:4:5
   |
 4 |     parts: [..] string;
   |     ^^^^^
   |
   = help: a fixed array does not allocate: `parts: [2] string;`, and the call that frees it goes away
   = note: `useless_resizable` is `warn` by default

warning[useless_resizable]: `numbers` is a resizable array that only ever holds 3 elements
  --> tests/lint/useless_resizable/bad.jai:13:5
   |
13 |     numbers: [..] int;
   |     ^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: a fixed array does not allocate: `numbers: [3] int;`
   = note: `useless_resizable` is `warn` by default
